@startuml seq-checkin
title In-class check-in

actor Student
participant "Student page" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant AttendanceService as Att
participant TokenService as Tok
participant AnomalyDetector as Det

Student -> UI : pick seat, allow microphone
UI -> UI : decode 18/19 kHz FSK\nor read the on-screen code
UI -> API : POST /challenge\n(device id + public key)
API -> Att : open_challenge
Att --> UI : challenge id + nonce
UI -> UI : sign challenge|nonce\nwith the device key
UI -> API : POST /checkin\n(signature, code, zone)
API -> Att : check_in
Att -> Att : reject if challenge is old,\nreused, or signature fails
Att -> Tok : verify HMAC for this\nwindow or the previous one
Tok --> Att : fresh, late, or mismatch
Att -> Att : reject a bad code or a code\nthis device already used
Att -> Det : recompute flags
Det --> API : confidence + flags
API --> Student : in-class result
@enduml
